This product includes software developed as an open (Apache-2.0) reference
implementation of a Modular Open Systems Approach (MOSA) conformance rules
pack and manifest ("MOSA-BOM") checker.

The underlying concept and design — the MOSA Domain Overlay, a non-disruptive
model-based overlay for assessing and enforcing MOSA compliance across programs
— originates with Tony Maida. This implementation is an independent open-source
realization of that concept.

MOSA is a U.S. Department of War / Department of Defense statutory acquisition
requirement (10 U.S.C. Section 4401). This project is an independent open-source
effort and is not endorsed by, affiliated with, or an official product of any
government agency. "FACE", "SOSA", "CMOSS", "VICTORY", and other standard names
referenced in the library are trademarks/marks of their respective owners and
are used here only for nominative reference.
